5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We should probably update how we split the bills. The current system feels a bit outdated now that we're five people.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! It's getting confusing. I want to know how to make it easier for everyone.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It would be good to see if the current split is actually fair for everyone's different habits.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I think we need to understand the actual costs over a full year before we change anything.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us to stop arguing about money. It makes the house feel sad sometimes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, if we want fairness, we should look at how much each room actually uses.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, can we also check how much work it takes to manage the payments?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,That's a good point. I'm curious if some of us are paying for others.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,We should also consider if there are any upfront costs for new systems.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,Maybe we can see if other houses have a better way of doing it?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll look into the room-by-room readings and the habits of houses that pay ahead.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll check the reconciliation template and the monthly settle at another house.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'll investigate the plug-in monitor readings and the sunlight and heating needs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I'll look at the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll check the payment log and the kitchen notice about the cooler.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
