31,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The monitor shows some rooms use four times more than others. Also, paying ahead seems to remove the guilt of using heat.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,The admin is a nightmare. A trial template required keying in every single invoice. It's way too much work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I found that some rooms get no sun and need heat much earlier. The usage gap is definitely real.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The bills fluctuate wildly—from 9,000 to nearly 30,000 yen. Also, sub-meters would cost 34,000 yen per room.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"People are paying late because they're confused, and some even suffered in the heat to avoid arguments.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, that's a huge price jump. No wonder we're all stressed in February.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Minato, that's exactly what I feared. The person doing the math is probably the one being avoided.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If the rooms are that different, a flat split is objectively unfair. We need a way to separate usage.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"But 34,000 yen per room is a steep entry cost. We have to weigh that against the monthly stress.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,I hate that we're sweating or freezing just to keep the peace.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we can stop the ""arithmetic in the head"" before turning on a light, the atmosphere would improve.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, but if we go for individual meters, does that just make the monthly logging harder?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It might, but it removes the ""carrying someone else"" resentment.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The volatility of the bills is the biggest issue for budgeting. A flat split doesn't fix the winter spike.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just want a system where we don't have to send reminders that feel like accusations.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It sounds like we need to balance fairness, budget stability, and low effort.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"Exactly. If it takes hours every month, I'm against it.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I still think we need to address the usage disparity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's see what the actual options are and if they solve these specific problems.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we can just agree on something that makes us friendly again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
56,3,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
